BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm .072705 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (Text) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( data type is used to store simple text values in game data. Unlike the LocalizedText data type, ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (Text) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( does) Tj T* 0 Tw .424004 Tw (not have support for multiple translations of the same text. Instead, it allows for the storage of any UTF symbol in a) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.055295 Tw (single language. This data type is useful for fields that do not require localization, such as ids, system names, tags or) Tj T* 0 Tw (asset paths.) Tj T* ET
