BT 1 0 0 1 0 50 Tm 1.413381 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (MultiPickList) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( data type allows a property to represent multiple values selected from a predefined list of) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.513561 Tw (options. It is designed for cases where multiple attributes, traits, or capabilities can be applied to a single entity) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.6657 Tw (simultaneously. Unlike PickList) Tj (, which limits the property to a single choice, ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (MultiPickList) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( enables the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.225606 Tw (combination of several boolean-like flags into a single compact representation. In the UI, MultiPickList is typically) Tj T* 0 Tw (presented as a dropdown menu, allowing users to select or deselect multiple options independently.) Tj T* ET
