BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm 2.598381 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (When using a ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (Reference) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, the target documents are not stored within the parent document but are instead) Tj T* 0 Tw .078273 Tw (referenced externally. This is particularly beneficial when working with large or complex data sets, where referencing) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.243182 Tw (is more efficient and maintains separation of concerns. It also promotes data integrity by ensuring that only valid) Tj T* 0 Tw (document references are maintained.) Tj T* ET
